    借 | jiè | borrow; lend | Has person radical 亻 on the left instead of 犭
    惜 | xī | cherish; pity; regret | Has heart radical 忄 on the left instead of 犭
    错 | cuò | mistake; wrong; complex | Has metal radical 钅 on the left
